# Boost on 21's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP refilled (party-level) and PP refilled (the four moves set again, as 20's boost gave them; auto_battle picks
# between them by type).
# For the tag battle vs TRAINER_GALACTIC_GRUNT_VEILSTONE_CITY_1/_2 (scripts_veilstone_city.s:503): beside the
# partner auto_battle scores Earthquake down (it would hit her too), so Crunch / Seed Bomb / Rock Slide carry it.
party-level 0 57
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
